   "headline": "Flagg's 12 assists lead Mavericks past Nuggets",
   "story": "Dallas went ahead for good at 9-7 in the first quarter and used a 17-0 run spanning halftime to lead 60-39. Denver scored 38 points in the third quarter and cut the gap to 80-77, but the Mavericks outscored the Nuggets 36-24 in the fourth and led by as many as 22. Cooper Flagg had 24 points, 12 assists and six rebounds, and Caleb Martin added 13 points with five steals as Dallas forced 18 turnovers. Jamal Murray scored 20 for Denver, and Nikola Jokić had 18 points, 11 rebounds and five turnovers.",
